            "review_title": "Review at Grand Square Convention Center & Restaurants",
            "review_text": "Travelasia2016\nThu Dau Mot, Vietnam63 contributions\n0\nLido Cafe\nApr 2015 • Friends\nThis is a new and definitely upscale. The Becamex is the main nice traveller and business traveller hotel and this new place is meant to cater to these travellers. There is more than one restaurant here. The Lido is on the lower level, They have really excellent Italian coffee and gelato. The employees understand and or speak very little English so some good humor and charades will help you with your order. In 2015 I went for coffee almost once a week. Unfortunately the food is not worth ordering. The breakfasts are limited. \nThere are two other restaurants in the building.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten February 1, 2016",
